# Interface

- Tokens in `tailwind.config.ts`. Surfaces: `surface-paper` / `surface-leather`. Dark: `on-dark`.
- Display = Cormorant (`font-display`, `text-d1`–`d5`). UI = IBM Plex (`font-sans`, `text-label`). Both include Cyrillic.
- Buttons: `act act-solid` | `act-outline` | `act-quiet`. Photographs: `Plate` or `ProductTile`, never a card.
- Typographic inventory: `Ledger`. Sheet: `SpecList`. Steps: `CraftSteps`. Kicker: `SectionLabel`.
- Only seal: `Seal`, `Ridge`, `Lozenge`, `Wordmark`, `CornerMarks`. No new frets.
- `Reveal` and `Parallax` stay quiet. No bounce, no scroll hijacking. Honour reduced-motion. Parallax is off below `md`.
- Home: the order in `app/[locale]/page.tsx` is the narrative. Do not turn `/` into a shop grid.
- Mobile has its own composition (hero: title first, photograph after). Do not stack the desktop.
- Mobile header: the overlay uses `hidden` or `flex` according to open state. Do not leave `flex` on.
- If a component does not fit, rebuild it. Do not pile CSS on top.
- Language switcher is text (`ES EN RU`). No flags.
